  {
    "name": "Formula-Mapped Shear Equilibrium Solver",
    "width": 1560,
    "height": 2550,
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "text": "Set the peak/valley target and accepted history; trial q\nstate: ascending-bracket scan and bisection; no trial commit",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 65,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 105,
        "kind": "round",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "crack",
        "text": "1. Crack kinematics (prescribed code relations)\ng(y)=(1−y/hc)^m; K=cosθ+r sinθ\nw₀=q/K; v₀=rw₀; w(y)=w₀g(y); v(y)=v₀g(y)\ncrack_deformation | S, Eq. 7 (PST/Green) not implemented",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 215,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 145,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "vc",
        "text": "2. Concrete shear (empirical code closure)\nVc=Vc0(1−exp(−q/qr))\n×[ρc+(1−ρc)exp(−w₀/wc)](1−Dc)\ntrial | empirical parameters require calibration",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 405,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 140,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "vs",
        "text": "3. Contribution of stirrups intersecting the crack\nεs,j=qg(yj)/ls; σs,j=min(Esεs,j,fy); Vs=ΣAs,jσs,j\nls is assumed; stirrup stress is zero when damage reaches 1\ntrial | stress cap/sum: R22, Eqs. 9a, 9c",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 590,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 140,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "EEF0F3"
      },
      {
        "id": "bar",
        "text": "4. Project crack motion onto each intact FRP bar\nδj=qg(yj)[sin(θ+αj)−r cos(θ+αj)]/K\nFor vertical bars (αj=90°): δj=qg(yj)\ntrial | not a direct substitution of S, Eq. 8",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 775,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 140,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "EEF0F3"
      },
      {
        "id": "tm",
        "text": "5. Update τm,i using local cycle counts [F, Eq. 2]\nτm,i=max{0,τm,0[1−kf log₁₀max(Ni,1)]}\nbond_strength; Ni counts local cycles after activation",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 960,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 115,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "bond",
        "text": "6. Trilinear bond envelope [F, Eq. 1]; tr=min(τr,τm,i)\nτenv=τm,i·s/δm                         s≤δm\nτenv=tr+(τm,i−tr)(δu−s)/(δu−δm)    δm<s≤δu\nτenv=tr                               s>δu\nbond | residual clipping and secant history: code additions",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1120,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 180,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "anchor",
        "text": "7. Discretize both anchors and integrate bond stress\ndT/dx=−pfτ; ds/dx=−T/(EfAf); free-end T=0\nTi(x)=pf∫[x,Li]τi(ξ)dξ | anchorage / anchor_mesh\nF, Eq. 10; S, Eq. 10: adapted to local anchor coordinates",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1345,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 150,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "compat",
        "text": "8. Enforce two-sided compatibility and strain continuity\ns₁(0)+s₂(0)=δj [S, Eq. 9d]; εf1(0)=εf2(0) [S, Eq. 11]\nThe same EfAf on both sides gives T₁(0)=T₂(0)\nNumerical iteration; not F, Eq. 9b or S, Eqs. 9a–c",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1540,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 150,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "fail",
        "text": "9. Check debonding, tensile and user cover limits\nRemove failed-bar force; repeat steps 4–9 for other bars\ntrial: tensile cap Af·ffu; no FRP material-fatigue law yet",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1735,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 125,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "EEF0F3"
      },
      {
        "id": "sum",
        "text": "10. Sum FRP vertical forces and total shear\nVf=nfaces ΣTj sinαj; V=Vc+Vs+Vf=Q/2\nSame force-decomposition idea as E, Eq. 1; Vf is NSM shear\nThe ECC-overlay split Vef,σ+Vef,τ is not used",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1905,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 150,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "ok",
        "text": "Valid local solution AND\n|V(q)−Q/2|≤forceTolerance?",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 2100,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 115,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "return",
        "text": "Return the balanced peak/valley state and local fields\nThe controller decides whether to accept the cycle block",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 2265,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "round",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "more",
        "text": "Further scan/bisection\nsearch available?",
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 2100,
        "w": 330,
        "h": 115,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "diag",
        "text": "Return a classified diagnostic\nNo selected-branch root /\nnumerical failure / resolution limit\nNo automatic IC-debonding label",
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 2265,
        "w": 330,
        "h": 140,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE2DE"
      }
    ],
